%% Event Organizer High-Level Sequence Diagram-Approve or Reject Applications
sequenceDiagram
    actor Organizer as Event Organizer
    participant System as Event Management System

    Organizer->>System: Select an application and submit a decision
    System->>System: Verify event ownership and application status
    System->>System: Check capacity if the decision is to approve
    alt Organizer owns the event and the decision can be applied
        System->>System: Update application status according to the decision
        System-->>Organizer: Confirm the updated application status
    else Ownership, status, or capacity prevents the update
        System-->>Organizer: Indicate that the application status was not changed
    end
